{"comment":"The WebSocket entry of air-ide for the host page. The step wsHandshake {origin, host, expect} opens a WebSocket to ws://127.0.0.1:${port}/ with these headers and expects the HTTP status; null for origin sends no Origin header. Each later line of the link page is one text frame of the last WebSocket that opened. The step wsClose {closeCode} expects air-ide to close it, or closes it from the page."}
